      "/description": {
        "leading": [
          " examples/74-deep-book — THE FROZEN DEEP FIXTURE for the one-wire migration: the wire goldens,",
          " the /api/content round-trips, and the chapter face-parity gate all walk this tree. Every",
          " storage trait the projection must carry appears at least once (member dirs with pointer",
